flowchart TD
    Start([Task arrives\nfor new repo]) --> CheckSpec{Spec exists\nin DB?}

    CheckSpec -->|Yes\nStatusValidated| UseSpec[Use cached spec\nSkip bootstrap]
    CheckSpec -->|ErrNotFound| RunBootstrap[Run bootstrap pipeline]
    CheckSpec -->|StatusFailing| AutoHeal[AutoHeal mode\nPreamble with prior scripts]
    AutoHeal --> RunBootstrap

    RunBootstrap --> Clone[setup-clone.sh\ngit clone repo into sandbox]
    Clone --> Detect[detect.go\nRead files to fingerprint repo:\nDockerfile, package.json,\ngo.mod, Makefile…]
    Detect --> Hints[Hints struct:\nLanguage, Framework,\nHasDocker, HasMakefile…]
    Hints --> PromptBuild[Build bootstrap prompt:\nHints + AutoHeal preamble\nif prior spec exists]

    PromptBuild --> ClaudeLoop{Bootstrap loop\nmax N iterations}

    ClaudeLoop --> RunClaude[Run Claude Code\nwith bootstrap prompt]
    RunClaude --> AgentWrites[Agent writes to /tmp/hetchy-spec/:\nmanifest.json\nsetup.sh\nstart.sh\nhealth.sh]

    AgentWrites --> RunSetup[Run setup.sh\ninstall deps, build…]
    RunSetup --> RunStart[Run start.sh &\nlaunch app in background]
    RunStart --> PollHealth{Poll health.sh\ntimeout 60s}

    PollHealth -->|health check passes| Bootstrap_OK[Bootstrap SUCCESS]
    PollHealth -->|timeout / error| IterBudget{Iterations\nexhausted?}

    IterBudget -->|No| DiagnosePrompt[Diagnose prompt:\nfailure output + prior scripts\nask Claude to fix]
    DiagnosePrompt --> ClaudeLoop

    IterBudget -->|Yes| Bootstrap_Fail[Bootstrap FAILED\nErrLoopFailed]

    Bootstrap_Fail --> PersistFailing[Persist StatusFailing spec\nwith partial scripts\nfor future AutoHeal]

    Bootstrap_OK --> SaveSpec[Save Spec to DB\nStatusValidated\nInstallID + RepoID keyed]
    SaveSpec --> MergePrompt[MergeIntoAgentPrompt\nAppend validation instructions\nto main agent prompt]

    UseSpec --> MergePrompt
    MergePrompt --> SendToAgent[Send to agent.sh\nWith SF_SPEC_SETUP_B64\nSF_SPEC_START_B64\nSF_SPEC_HEALTH_B64]

    SendToAgent --> AgentRuns[Agent runs:\n1. Decode + run setup.sh\n2. Start app\n3. Poll health\n4. Make changes\n5. Validate via screenshots\n6. Open PR]

    AgentRuns --> PostSuccess[Post-success:\nRead /tmp/hetchy-spec/improved/\nApply any script improvements\nMarkApplied → StatusValidated]

    style Bootstrap_OK fill:#c8e6c9,stroke:#2E7D32
    style Bootstrap_Fail fill:#ffcdd2,stroke:#B71C1C
    style UseSpec fill:#c8e6c9,stroke:#2E7D32
    style AutoHeal fill:#fff9c4,stroke:#F57F17
